    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "Use these constants to control the conditions that allow fallback camera selection when you set the value of the [`primaryConstituentDeviceSwitchingBehavior`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdeviceswitchingbehavior-swift.property.md) property to [`AVCaptureDevice.PrimaryConstituentDeviceSwitchingBehavior.restricted`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdeviceswitchingbehavior-swift.enum/restricted.md).",
      "ko": "[`primaryConstituentDeviceSwitchingBehavior`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdeviceswitchingbehavior-swift.property.md) 속성 값을 [`AVCaptureDevice.PrimaryConstituentDeviceSwitchingBehavior.restricted`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdeviceswitchingbehavior-swift.enum/restricted.md)로 설정할 때, fallback 카메라 선택을 허용하는 조건을 제어하려면 이 상수를 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "66e9fc014f357221383f5d8a169b307d865e07b124a4bf0a911cb21640b8b749",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "When triggered by one or more enabled conditions, fallback camera switching waits for exposure and focus to stabilize before deciding which camera to use as the primary constituent device.",
      "ko": "하나 이상의 조건이 활성화되어 트리거되면 대체 카메라 전환은 노출과 초점이 안정화될 때까지 대기한 뒤 primary constituent device로 어떤 카메라를 사용할지 결정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d0e15cf8d229cda1a9c8914ab61dc5c3b1738fc50534b32d7488e1aa8cb27a23",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0010:0001",
      "source": "Whenever [`videoZoomChanged`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions-swift.struct/videozoomchanged.md) isn’t included in the restricted switching behavior conditions, [`AVCaptureDevice.PrimaryConstituentDeviceSwitchingBehavior.restricted`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdeviceswitchingbehavior-swift.enum/restricted.md) still allows camera selection when a change in video zoom factor makes a camera eligible or ineligible for selection as the [`activePrimaryConstituent`](avcapturedevice/activeprimaryconstituent.md).",
      "ko": "[`videoZoomChanged`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions-swift.struct/videozoomchanged.md)가 제한된 전환 동작 조건에 포함되지 않은 경우에도 [`AVCaptureDevice.PrimaryConstituentDeviceSwitchingBehavior.restricted`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdeviceswitchingbehavior-swift.enum/restricted.md)는 비디오 줌 팩터 변경으로 카메라가 [`activePrimaryConstituent`](avcapturedevice/activeprimaryconstituent.md)로 선택되거나 선택 대상에서 제외되는 경우 카메라 선택을 허용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7bba1391092d861584ae1f3318286170c22f4fecdf1a02ea18c13da80ccbd90b",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0011:0001",
      "source": "When the video zoom factor decreases to below the switch-over zoom factor of the active primary constituent device, the system selects a different camera to satisfy the requested zoom factor.",
      "ko": "비디오 줌 팩터가 활성 primary constituent device의 전환 임계 줌 팩터보다 낮아지면 시스템은 요청된 줌 팩터를 충족하기 위해 다른 카메라를 선택합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a6915482f035b08a88dee965c8c03e027b02f4c7b6430375745730930c2c0f40",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0012:0001",
      "source": "When the video zoom factor increases and crosses a camera’s switch-over zoom factor, this camera becomes eligible to set as the [`activePrimaryConstituent`](avcapturedevice/activeprimaryconstituent.md).",
      "ko": "비디오 줌 팩터가 증가해 카메라의 전환 임계 줌 팩터를 넘으면 이 카메라는 [`activePrimaryConstituent`](avcapturedevice/activeprimaryconstituent.md)로 설정할 수 있는 자격을 갖습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "cd99c7a95c91ca4335c007fe17a6572db102c6d2359972097204d303818ae3d1",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0012:0002",
      "source": "If exposure and focus allow, this camera then becomes the new active primary constituent device.",
      "ko": "노출과 초점이 허용되면 이 카메라는 새 active primary constituent device가 됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "25fc03f5764b7806a196809e81242cc14e9e5a180168a6ea18ccb0cbbadf48f6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0012:0003",
      "source": "Similar to the [`videoZoomChanged`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions-swift.struct/videozoomchanged.md) this also waits for exposure and focus to stabilize.",
      "ko": "이 경우는 [`videoZoomChanged`](avcapturedevice/primaryconstituentdevicerestrictedswitchingbehaviorconditions-swift.struct/videozoomchanged.md)와 유사하게 노출과 초점이 안정화될 때까지 대기합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "9a97d591dcd2a364a467f0b9b69ae516b3b9896fdcd15ad9ff22baa879a53a10",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0012:0004",
      "source": "Otherwise the [`activePrimaryConstituent`](avcapturedevice/activeprimaryconstituent.md) remains unchanged.",
      "ko": "그렇지 않으면 [`activePrimaryConstituent`](avcapturedevice/activeprimaryconstituent.md)는 변경되지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "c8991c8a3c41fbf36e68ba85d0adf76a16470265b4bf8fee34093af39d14f59c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
